{"id": "69085", "title": "爱是人生最好的相逢／钟爱", "author": "夜蔓", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 15, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69085.htm", "intro": "年少时，林艾与许晔轩的相遇是场美丽的错误。\r\n 多年之后，林艾与钟朗相遇，是命中注定。\r\n 强势的钟朗，温柔的许晔轩，林艾该何去何从。\r\n 一段爱情牵扯出过往种种，终究谁与谁。\r\n 林艾说：她只想找一个可以依靠的人，慢慢到老——这个人不一定要很有钱，不一定要多英俊，只要能给她一个完整家。\r\n 他是她的独一\r\n 我是所有人的无二\r\n 世界充满了我们相遇的几率\r\n 我却始终无法遇见你\r\n ——徐志摩\r\n 我的专栏：\r\n 我的新文:\r\n 网络版至此，小番外不定时奉上。\r\n 读者1群：171875598（已满）\r\n 读者2群：16752650（未满）", "base": "files/article/html/69/69085", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章", "file": "10557300.html", "available": false}, {"title": "2-7", "file": "10557301.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8-12", "file": "10557302.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13-17", "file": "10557303.html", "available": false}, {"title": "18-22", "file": "10557304.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23-26", "file": "10557305.html", "available": false}, {"title": "27-31", "file": "10557306.html", "available": false}, {"title": "32-36", "file": "10557307.html", "available": false}, {"title": "37-39", "file": "10557308.html", "available": false}, {"title": "40-43", "file": "10557309.html", "available": false}, {"title": "44-47", "file": "10557310.html", "available": false}, {"title": "48-52", "file": "10557311.html", "available": false}, {"title": "53-56", "file": "10557312.html", "available": false}, {"title": "57-60", "file": "10557313.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-63完结", "file": "10557314.html", "available": false}]}